SUMMARY:Jason Whitaker at the Hilton Garden Inn South!
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n# RSVP's will start again on Tuesday Ju
 ne 16.\n\n# Start your weekend with melodic tunes at the Garden Inn South\
 , featuring Jason Whitaker\n\nEnjoy your friends and the food and drinks f
 rom the Garden Grille & Bar while listening to Jason Whitaker (He plays fr
 om 6pm - 9pm).\n\nJason is an expressive multi decade Light Rock guitarist
  and balladeer (think: Eagles\, Clapton\, Seger\, James Taylor\, Jim Croce
 \, Mellencamp\, Fleetwood Mac\, Bon Jovi\, even a little Elvis). Come unwi
 nd with us at the relaxing and comfortable garden setting for a musical ev
 ening at the Hilton by the Asheville Outlets.\n\nThere is free parking in 
 both the front of the hotel and behind it as well.\nCarpooling is encourag
 ed.\n\nThe Hilton is right near the Asheville Tanger Outlet Mall. Take Exi
 t 33 (Brevard Road) off Highway 26. Parking is free!\n\nThe music is free!
  Please show your appreciation by tipping.\n\n**Hilton Garden Inn Ashevill
 e South**\n9 Rocky Ridge Rd\nAsheville\, NC 28806\nPhone: (828) 633-6024
